    "category": "absolute_claim",
    "claim_provenance": "source_authored",
    "source_file": ".changeset/issue-1915-scrub-escape-backslash.md",
    "source_excerpt": "Both classes are now `\\`-free and carry a four-character minimum, so only the credential token is replaced and the bytes around it survive. The redacted shapes are unchanged."
   },
